# Each time Skycoach Conductor enters it enters prepared (CR 722.3a), and it is a new object each time (CR 400.7). Bot1 flashes
# it in, casts the copy of All Aboard (U) on its Ornithopter, which unprepares it, then Ephemerates the Conductor itself: it
# returns as a new object, prepared again, with a fresh All Aboard copy waiting in exile (the Ephemerate itself waits there
# for rebound). All Aboard itself could not target the Conductor (a Pilot), but Ephemerate can.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Skycoach Conductor
Ornithopter
Ephemerate
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Skycoach Conductor.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Exile.All Aboard.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Skycoach Conductor.Prepared = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ephemerate.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Skycoach Conductor)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Skycoach Conductor.Prepared = true
Exile = All Aboard; Ephemerate
